  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Adds the Site resource family for web sites a browser loads: SiteIdentifier, SiteConfig loaded from the new Site configuration section, and the web.site environment requirement kind. LoadWebConfig() now also registers WebConfigStore<SiteConfig>, so an environment that serves a site at run time has somewhere to publish its address. Requires TestFramework.Core 0.3.0 and TestFramework.Config 0.2.1.",
